<title>FRANCE: Publicis sees double-digit profit growth.</title>
<headline>Publicis sees double-digit profit growth.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advertising group Publicis expects double-digit profit growth for 1997, chairman Maurice Levy said on Friday.  </p>
<p>&quot;I don't think I'm getting ahead of myself if I say growth will be in double digits,&quot; he told the annual general meeting.</p>
<p>He said revenue was expected to rise five percent or slightly more.</p>
<p>Publicis' net attributable profit rose 21 percent in 1996 to 185 million francs on sales of 21.9 billion.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
